          "chunk_id": "s01_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c2_authors_introduce_deep_demonstration",
          "text": "The authors introduce Deep Demonstration Tracing, or DDT, a method that lets an imitator agent adaptively trace the right states in a single demonstration while recovering from unforeseen obstacles.",
