          "chunk_id": "s01_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c3_ddt_combines_purpose_built_demonstra",
          "text": "DDT combines a purpose-built demonstration transformer with a meta-reinforcement-learning training scheme, and it outperforms prior one-shot imitation methods across a new maze navigation benchmark and several robotics tasks.",
          "expected_role": "method",
          "cue_keywords": [
