          "chunk_id": "s02_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c2_after_demonstration_provided_unexpec",
          "text": "After the demonstration is provided, an unexpected obstacle can appear, or a grasped object can slip, pushing the agent into situations the demonstration never covered.",
