          "chunk_id": "s02_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c3_traditional_one_shot_imitation_metho",
          "text": "Traditional one-shot imitation methods excel in stationary settings, yet their ability to handle these unforeseen changes is limited and rarely studied.",
