          "chunk_id": "s03_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c3_easy_people_but_hard_current",
          "text": "This is easy for people but hard for current one-shot imitation techniques, which mostly clone demonstrated actions and have no principled way to behave in states the demonstration never showed.",
