          "chunk_id": "s03_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c4_authors_distill_human_behavior_three",
          "text": "The authors distill this human behavior into a three-stage decision process — identify which demonstrated states are relevant, analyze how the expert behaved there, and trace back onto the demonstration — and use it as the blueprint for their method.",
