          "chunk_id": "s04_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c2_first_advances_one_shot_imitation_se",
          "text": "First, it advances the one-shot imitation setting by deliberately introducing a large difference between when the demonstration is collected and when the policy is deployed, and it supports this with a new demonstration-navigation benchmark.",
