          "chunk_id": "s04_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c3_second_proposes_demonstration_transf",
          "text": "Second, it proposes a demonstration transformer architecture that encourages the policy to trace the demonstration, following the three-stage identify, analyze, and trace process.",
