          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c4_third_addresses_one_shot_imitation_c",
          "text": "Third, it addresses one-shot imitation as a context-based meta-reinforcement-learning problem, and it theoretically analyzes the conditions under which an imitator can succeed from just a single trajectory.",
