          "anchor_id": "cue_s06_c1_test_one_shot_imitation_under_unfore",
          "text": "To test one-shot imitation under unforeseen change, the authors created a benchmark called Valet Parking Assist in Maze, or VPAM, inspired by real-world valet parking.",
